Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.63,0:00:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go. All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.21,0:00:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure. Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't you supposed to be\Nout hunting with the guild today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.31,0:00:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to take the day off cuz I sort of\Nhave the same little meeting with someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.99,0:00:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.90,0:00:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you have a little me, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.39,0:00:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he must be pretty\Nspecial whoever he is, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.67,0:00:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:00:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's rude to keep your date waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.79,0:00:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.55,0:01:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'll ever\Nfind someone special.
