Dialogue: 3,0:02:43.03,0:02:47.04,title,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.9\clip(0,825,1920,828)\pos(960,825)\c&HCEA616&}The Temperature Of The Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:02:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good enough, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better get ready for the customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.89,0:03:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Lizbeth's blacksmith shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.83,0:03:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I was wondering if\Nyou do custom orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.65,0:03:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look like\Nhe has that much money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.25,0:03:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.31,0:03:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, metal prices\Nare kinda high these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.27,0:03:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I'm not worried about the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.69,0:03:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want the best sword you\Ncan make as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I make a lot of different swords,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.57,0:03:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you have any idea of the quality\Nof swords you want, I can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure. One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.07,0:03:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'm looking for something either\Nthe same quality, or better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.63,0:03:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An elucidator!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.07,0:03:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the gnarliest magic sword a\Nperson can get from a monster drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.99,0:04:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.23,0:04:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the best sword I ever forged.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.07,0:04:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call it my masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.03,0:04:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, it's a little light.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.39,0:04:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used a speed-type metal to forge it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to test it if\Nit's cool. Test it how?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.31,0:04:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, it's durability.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.31,0:04:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you break your sword,\NI'm not responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it breaks, then that's too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You broke my... masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.61,0:04:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.75,0:05:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think yours\Nwas gonna break so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying my sword, my masterpiece\Nof a sword was labor than you thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your information,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.93,0:05:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I had the right materials,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.61,0:05:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could make a buttload\Nof swords that would
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.19,0:05:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shatter yours into a\Nmillion tiny little pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.57,0:05:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.07,0:05:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds like the kind\Nof sword I'm looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as it can shatter mine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.89,0:05:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, smarty pants, but you have to\Nhelp me make it every step of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.57,0:05:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.57,0:05:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely, and we'll start\Nby getting the medal for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I can handle that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not have you slowing me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.81,0:05:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare insult me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.43,0:05:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, I'm\Nan expert mace user.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, where do we find the metal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.83,0:05:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Floor 55 on the western mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.17,0:05:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a dragon there that eats crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the legends, it's supposed\Nto store a rare metal in its body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.55,0:05:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Floor 55, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I should go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.51,0:06:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they say that in order to get the metal,\Nyou need to bring a master smith along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.81,0:06:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still think going alone's a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.23,0:06:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, just keep quiet\Nand stay out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.47,0:06:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep quiet and...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, my name's Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.75,0:06:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're a party\Nuntil we make that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.09,0:06:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.81,0:06:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're gonna be like\Nthat, I can roll with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.97,0:06:37.22,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H22201C&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&\fscx105}55{\fscx95}th Floor • Western Mountain
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.97,0:06:37.22,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H22201C&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H30\fscx105}55{\fscx95}th Floor • Western Mountain
Dialogue: 2,0:06:33.97,0:06:37.22,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\shad0\pos(960,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&\fscx105}55{\fscx95}th Floor • Western Mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.05,0:06:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hatsi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.97,0:06:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you should have\Nbrought a coat or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know Floor 55 was\Ngoing to be this freaking cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.77,0:06:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to be okay without this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.17,0:06:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't feel cold if you're disciplined.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to piss\Nme off, it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's warm, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm out here\Nall alone with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.49,0:07:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Lisbeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.35,0:07:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giving up already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.63,0:07:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not on your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.13,0:07:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you're gonna be a jerk about\Nit, you might as well call me Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.57,0:07:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.63,0:07:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, don't wear it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.27,0:07:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.47,0:07:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should get your\Nteleport crystal ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.27,0:07:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I know, I'm doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.61,0:07:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm handling this part on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the dragon appears,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going to hide under one\Nof those crystals over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.19,0:07:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come out no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.93,0:07:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a noob.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I want to help you, I'll darn well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do what I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.13,0:08:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and take cover! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a breath attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.71,0:08:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, and with that\Nskinny sword, who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.21,0:08:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, stop playing with\Nit and finish it up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come out yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.97,0:09:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it right where you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.89,0:09:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liz!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on to me, Liz!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.19,0:09:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we still alive? Yeah, it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it drink one of these just in case
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.19,0:10:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Eno, for...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.19,0:10:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for saving me It's a little\Nearly to be thanking anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find a way to\Nget out of here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.95,0:10:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.89,0:10:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we just teleport out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.45,0:10:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teleport Lindis!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.53,0:10:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if we can't use crystals, that\Nmeans there should be another way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.51,0:10:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be so sure there is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, maybe this is some kind of trap\Nrig to kill anyone who falls into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.41,0:10:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would it kill you to at\Nleast try to cheer me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.97,0:10:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.71,0:10:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.62,0:10:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could try rounding up the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but that's all I\Ngot for ideas right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.89,0:10:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had more of a running start,\NI probably would have made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.89,0:11:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is kind of weird, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This wouldn't happen in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.59,0:11:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, going to strange places,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.45,0:11:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meeting a total stranger, and\Nthen sleeping next to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you actually tried\Nrunning up that wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.97,0:11:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are a weirdo, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.47,0:11:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, can I ask you something?\NAsk away. I'm all ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you risk your\Nlife like that to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.05,0:11:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit back\Nand watch someone die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.25,0:11:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die alongside\Nhim than do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.47,0:11:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially if that's someone's\Na girl like you, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.57,0:12:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you really are an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.21,0:12:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only person\Nwho'd think like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.43,0:12:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.81,0:12:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.49,0:12:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though you and me are just these\Nones and zeros in a virtual world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.47,0:12:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.95,0:13:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.93,0:13:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Here, look.
