Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.04,0:13:11.08,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\alpha&H55&\an2\fs39\pos(981.75,447.75)\c&HC5C4C1&\clip(m 858 421.5 l 1111.5 421.5 1113 457.5 858 457.5)}Crystallite Ingot
Dialogue: 2,0:13:11.08,0:13:17.88,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\alpha&H55&\an2\fs39\pos(981,447)\c&H9B9A97&}Crystallite Ingot
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.08,0:13:17.88,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\alpha&H55&\an2\fs39\pos(981.75,447.75)\c&HC5C4C1&}Crystallite Ingot
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that special metal\Nwe came all this way for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.49,0:13:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you said, the dragon eats crystals,\Nand they turn to this in its stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder it's hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.21,0:13:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.21,0:13:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it doing down here, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.17,0:13:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This hole isn't a trap like we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.49,0:13:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the dragon's den. R-really? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.15,0:13:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not just an ingot,\Nthat's dragon excrement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.29,0:13:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, poop. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.35,0:13:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess this means we\Ngot what we came here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.49,0:13:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still stuck, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.09,0:13:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is supposed to be\Na dragon's nest, right? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.07,0:13:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because dragons are nocturnal, so\Nit won't be long before it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.01,0:14:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.05,0:14:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.99,0:14:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.05,0:14:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.27,0:14:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on to me, Liz!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.33,0:14:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.58,0:14:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.93,0:15:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.27,0:15:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't freak out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.77,0:15:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm falling in love with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.01,0:15:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.77,0:15:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.25,0:15:30.26,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,450)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\c&H121212&\4c&H101628&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&\pos(983.001,945)}June {\fscx110}25{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95\fsp1.5}   {\fsp-1.5\fscx100}48{\fscx95}th Floor • Lindarth
