Dialogue: 2,0:15:26.25,0:15:30.26,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,450)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&\pos(981.501,942)}June {\fscx110}25{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95\fsp1.5}   {\fsp-1.5\fscx100}48{\fscx95}th Floor • Lindarth
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.31,0:15:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A one-handed longsword, right? Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.51,0:15:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.95,0:15:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't imagine it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.87,0:15:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The warmth of Kirito's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.69,0:15:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as I've made the best sword I can,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.67,0:15:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.71,0:16:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sword is called Dark Repulsor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.35,0:16:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.85,0:16:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's not even in the\NInfobroker's directory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.47,0:16:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, try it. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.49,0:16:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good? Bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.03,0:16:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's real heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.43,0:16:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good sword. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.01,0:16:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like you forged\Nyour soul into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you held up your end of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to pay up, so how much?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, well, I don't really need any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.53,0:16:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to be your exclusive\Nblacksmith from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Exclusive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anytime you get back from the field, stop\Nby and let me do maintenance on your gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.99,0:17:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.09,0:17:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liz I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.69,0:17:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.91,0:17:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liz I was so worried
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.83,0:17:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, Liz? Where were you last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.99,0:17:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried messaging you, but you didn't\Nanswer and I couldn't track you on the map!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.29,0:17:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I kinda got stuck\Nin a dungeon. A dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.13,0:17:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You went all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.01,0:17:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.92,0:17:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.53,0:17:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.44,0:17:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.71,0:17:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been what, like two days?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.01,0:17:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.51,0:18:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you wanted\Nto check this place out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.57,0:18:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you would have told me\NI could have come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sort of confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.65,0:18:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.81,0:18:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, both of us are on\Nthe assault team, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.05,0:18:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he was looking to\Nget a more powerful sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.81,0:18:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I told him about you and your shop. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.91,0:18:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is she acting like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.51,0:18:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, if you did\Nanything weird to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.39,0:18:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.97,0:18:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why'd you stutter just now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.39,0:18:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you could try to\Nshow a little more compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost got killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.61,0:18:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like that's my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.13,0:18:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't I always tell you not to fight Solo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.93,0:18:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.41,0:18:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.05,0:18:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this guy said anything\Nrude, you'd tell me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.07,0:18:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liz?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.17,0:18:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to talk about rude?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.93,0:18:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First thing he does when he comes\Nin is shatter my best sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.11,0:18:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.81,0:18:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.73,0:18:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to apologize for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.53,0:19:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be a little weird,\Nbut he's not such a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't screw this up, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.61,0:19:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I told you, it's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liz?
