Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.91,0:19:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're gonna leave the store?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold down the fort for me. Later! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, Liz!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.63,0:19:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisbeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.11,0:19:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost got away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A couple more minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.97,0:19:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I would have gone back\Nto my usual cheerful self.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.51,0:19:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liz, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.91,0:19:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you know I was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I scanned the whole town\Nfor you from up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.05,0:20:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Figures you'd do\Nsomething crazy like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.35,0:20:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry if I worried you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.15,0:20:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.67,0:20:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be all the excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.79,0:20:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not used to having adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.85,0:20:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll just forget\Neverything I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.77,0:20:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.57,0:20:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liz, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.11,0:20:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.31,0:20:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always thought dying was better\Nthan surviving day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.65,0:20:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Living with the guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.93,0:20:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.13,0:20:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, we got stuck in that hole, and\NI was really happy we were still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.43,0:20:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realized that even here, our\Nlives are real and have meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping me see that, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.09,0:21:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's what I've been\Nlooking for this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.33,0:21:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.97,0:21:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.27,0:21:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was also looking for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.17,0:21:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something real.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoping I'd find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.03,0:21:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The warmth of your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.15,0:21:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For me, that was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.15,0:21:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.97,0:21:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us to know what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.11,0:21:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.99,0:21:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.61,0:21:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The getting over it part,\Nthat's gonna take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.93,0:21:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until I do, promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll put\Nan end to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till then, I'll keep doing what I do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.59,0:21:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.59,0:21:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll beat the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.37,0:21:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ever need your weapons or\Ngear repaired, my door's always open.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.93,0:21:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.29,0:22:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.53,0:22:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll always be welcome at my shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.37,0:22:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
